Every useful working keeps its own practice history.

  Copied          0 casts     ordinary casting
  Practiced      50 casts     first rune socket; barrage access if eligible
  Fluent        150 casts     better efficiency and quicker barrage
  Inscribed     250 casts     second rune socket; better efficiency
  Instinctive  1000 casts     best ordinary efficiency and barrage cadence

A useful cast normally adds one point. Repeating the same page faster than the
spellbook can settle it, or attacking something far below your level, does not
teach the working. Delayed workings count when they resolve successfully, not
when their geometry first opens.

Use "spellbook" for every known page, "spellbook <working>" for one page, and
"runes" for the patterns that can occupy its sockets.
